// An array as a value, targets: `x = c[fa]`. KIELER rejects it: array subscript is not an integer.
scchart Main { input bool b input int i int a[2] = {4,7} int c[2] = {4,7} int m[2][2] = {{4,7},{8,1}} float fa[2] bool ba[2] output int x output float f output bool y initial state A do x = c[fa] go to A }
